 "remarks": "Welcome to 52 Devils Garden Road, a private and beautifully maintained retreat set on over half an acre in a coveted Norwalk location just moments from Rowayton. Surrounded by mature greenery and tucked away from the everyday, this special property offers a rare sense of privacy and serenity paired with exceptional convenience. Designed for effortless one-level living, the main floor features three bedrooms, one-and-a-half baths, and bright, inviting living spaces. The generous living room, anchored by a cozy fireplace, offers a warm and welcoming setting for gathering, while the eat-in kitchen opens directly to an expansive deck overlooking the lush backyard. Outside, a beautiful patio and outdoor kitchen create an exceptional setting for al fresco dining, entertaining, or simply enjoying a quiet evening surrounded by nature.  The finished walk-out lower level adds valuable flexibility and feels like a private space of its own. Complete with an additional bedroom and full bath, this level is ideal for guests, including a recreation room, home office/gym and playroom.  Embrace the quintessential coastal Connecticut lifestyle with the Rowayton train station just a 10-minute walk away, offering an approximately one-hour commute to Manhattan. Enjoy easy access to local beaches and marinas, along with Rowayton's waterfront, charming shops, and celebrated restaurants. Vibrant SoNo is just minutes away, while Wegmans, Costco, and Target provide effortless everyday convenience.",
